{"step_index":1167,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-13T16:10:50Z","input_tokens":5305,"cache_read_tokens":166090,"output_tokens":3355,"thinking":"Initial analysis confirms SCF convergence across all steps of the simulation. This aligns with the first verification goal, indicating stable electronic structure calculations throughout the trajectory. Examining the SCF convergence behavior across the trajectory is helpful to identify any potential instabilities.\n\n\nSCF convergence is clean, with an average of 18.9 iterations per step. The temperature oscillates around the virial-partitioned value and increases over time due to the thermostat. Initial velocities corresponding to a 300K temperature at Step 0, eventually converge to around 150-190K by Step 12.\n\n\nMaximum surface atom displacement is 0.1351 Å, indicating surface vibrations. The root mean square displacement for surface atoms is 0.0934 Å. This analysis covers more than three full periods of the optical phonon vibration, providing sufficient data for the assessment.\n\n\nAnalysis shows the root mean square displacement of surface atoms peaked at 0.0542 Å between steps 38-40, with a mean of 0.0400 Å. The inter-slab gap narrowed by a maximum of 0.2060 Å, from 6.1184 Å to 5.9124 Å at Step 38, before rebounding. This turn-around in the gap suggests the phonon mode also reversed at Step 38. The data suggests the surface dynamics are stable and consistent throughout the simulation.\n\n\nThe most helpful graphs will be the standard progression graphs generated by the script, along with AIMD-specific analyses showing temperature, energies, surface displacements, and inter-slab gap variations over time. These visualizations will directly support an understanding of the simulation's dynamics. Also consider updating the surface energy results with the phase 1 result.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_env_rtx5080/bin/python3 -c \"\nimport os, csv, subprocess\nimport numpy as np\nos.environ['MPLCONFIGDIR'] = '/tmp/matplotlib_cache_sic'\nimport matplotlib\nmatplotlib.use('Agg')\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport matplotlib.font_manager as fm\n\naimd_dir = 'aimd_2H-SiC_10-10_8periods_vac3.0A_300K_100steps_rtx5080'\nsubprocess.run(['/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_env_rtx5080/bin/python3', 'auto_generate_progression_graphs.py'], cwd=aimd_dir, check=False)\n\n# Load summary CSV\nrows = []\nwith open(os.path.join(aimd_dir, 'aimd_100steps_summary.csv'), encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    reader = csv.DictReader(f)\n    for r in reader:\n        rows.append({k: float(v) for k, v in r.items()})\n\nt = [r['time_fs'] for r in rows]\ntemp = [r['temp_K'] for r in rows]\netot = [r['etotal_eV'] for r in rows]\npe = [r['pe_eV'] for r in rows]\nke = [r['ke_eV'] for r in rows]\ngap = [r['gap_A'] for r in rows]\ndz_max = [r['dz_max_surf_A'] for r in rows]\ndz_rms = [r['dz_rms_surf_A'] for r in rows]\n\nmincho_path = os.path.join(aimd_dir, 'msmincho.ttc')\ntimes_path = os.path.join(aimd_dir, 'times.ttf')\nprop_jp = fm.FontProperties(fname=mincho_path, size=11) if os.path.exists(mincho_path) else None\nprop_en = fm.FontProperties(fname=times_path, size=10.5) if os.path.exists(times_path) else None\n\n# Plot 1: Surface Displacement (|dz|_max and dz_rms) & Inter-slab Gap\nfig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(2, 1, figsize=(6.0, 5.2), dpi=300, sharex=True)\nax1.plot(t, dz_max, color='#8A2BE2', lw=1.6, label='最大変位 |Δz|_max (最表面原子)')\nax1.plot(t, dz_rms, color='#1E90FF', lw=1.6, ls='--', label='二乗平均変位 Δz_rms (最表面36原子)')\nax1.set_ylabel('表面原子 Z方向変位 [Å]', fontproperties=prop_jp)\nax1.set_ylim(0.0, 0.25)\nax1.grid(True, ls=':', alpha=0.5)\nax1.tick_params(direction='in', top=True, right=True)\nif prop_jp:\n    ax1.legend(prop=prop_jp, loc='upper left', frameon=True)\n\nax2.plot(t, gap, color='#2E8B57', lw=1.8, label='スラブ間ギャップ d_gap')\nax2.axhline(6.1184, color='#666666', ls=':', lw=1.0, label='初期ギャップ (6.12 Å)')\nax2.set_xlabel('時間 [fs]', fontproperties=prop_jp)\nax2.set_ylabel('スラブ間ギャップ [Å]', fontproperties=prop_jp)\nax2.set_ylim(5.0, 6.5)\nax2.set_xlim(0, 100)\nax2.grid(True, ls=':', alpha=0.5)\nax2.tick_params(direction='in', top=True, right=True)\nif prop_jp:\n    ax2.legend(prop=prop_jp, loc='lower left', frameon=True)\n\nplt.tight_layout()\nfor ext in ['png', 'pdf', 'svg']:\n    fig.savefig(os.path.join(aimd_dir, f'AIMD_Surface_Displacement_and_Gap_100steps.{ext}'), dpi=300)\nplt.close(fig)\n\n# Plot 2: Temperature and Total Energy\nfig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.subplots(2, 1, figsize=(6.0, 5.2), dpi=300, sharex=True)\nax1.plot(t, temp, color='#D2691E', lw=1.6)\nax1.axhline(300.0, color='#222222', ls='--', lw=1.0)\nax1.set_ylabel('温度 T [K]', fontproperties=prop_jp)\nax1.set_ylim(0, 350)\nax1.grid(True, ls=':', alpha=0.5)\nax1.tick_params(direction='in', top=True, right=True)\n\nax2.plot(t, etot, color='#8A2BE2', lw=1.6, label='全エネルギー (TotEng = PE + KE)')\nax2.plot(t, pe, color='#4682B4', lw=1.3, ls='--', label='ポテンシャルエネルギー (PotEng)')\nax2.set_xlabel('時間 [fs]', fontproperties=prop_jp)\nax2.set_ylabel('エネルギー [eV]', fontproperties=prop_jp)\nax2.set_xlim(0, 100)\nax2.ticklabel_format(useOffset=False, style='plain', axis='y')\nax2.grid(True, ls=':', alpha=0.5)\nax2.tick_params(direction='in', top=True, right=True)\nif prop_jp:\n    ax2.legend(prop=prop_jp, loc='center right', frameon=True)\n\nplt.tight_layout()\nfor ext in ['png', 'pdf', 'svg']:\n    fig.savefig(os.path.join(aimd_dir, f'AIMD_Temperature_and_Energy_100steps.{ext}'), dpi=300)\nplt.close(fig)\nprint('Generated AIMD analysis plots successfully.')\n\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolSummary":"Generate AIMD progression and surface displacement analysis graphs"}}]}
